WEBVTT

01:27.825 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.945 --> 01:36.025
How is Mr. Li?

01:40.065 --> 01:40.905
Don't worry.

01:41.505 --> 01:43.065
He's fine now.

01:45.305 --> 01:47.905
Mr. Li is truly blessed by the heavens.

01:47.985 --> 01:49.505
He's not destined to die here.

01:50.905 --> 01:53.265
Your Majesty, Mr. Li is out of danger.

01:53.785 --> 01:55.785
The name of Ghost King
is now renowned across the martial world.

01:56.585 --> 01:58.665
Judging by the relationship
between Lingbi Sect and Nanrong Palace,

01:59.425 --> 02:01.385
I suspect that the assassination
of Li Chengtian is just the start.

02:02.665 --> 02:04.385
Instead of letting
Lingbi Sect teach us what to do,

02:04.465 --> 02:06.065
we should act on our own initiative.

02:12.545 --> 02:13.545
Greetings, Young Lady.

02:13.625 --> 02:17.385
THE HALL OF REMEMBRANCE

02:17.465 --> 02:18.865
You all were once
my father's subordinates.

02:18.945 --> 02:20.065
Now,

02:20.665 --> 02:22.105
Father has been killed
by a despicable villain.

02:23.185 --> 02:24.545
Although she's the Imperial Preceptor,

02:25.065 --> 02:26.985
she has complete control of the court
and has plunged the world into chaos.

02:27.065 --> 02:29.145
We have to rectify the situation
as soon as possible.

02:29.665 --> 02:31.785
I've sent my men to summon
Jueding back to the palace.

02:32.385 --> 02:33.985
Were there any strange movements
within the court

02:34.065 --> 02:34.905
or the martial world?

02:36.385 --> 02:37.505
My Lady,

02:37.585 --> 02:40.425
a rumor has been circulating
within the martial world.

02:42.545 --> 02:43.945
What rumor?

02:44.025 --> 02:45.225
The Ghost King has appeared.

02:49.545 --> 02:51.745
All right. I understand.

02:51.825 --> 02:52.665
You all may go.

02:53.705 --> 02:54.625
Yes, My Lady.

03:11.985 --> 03:12.945
The Ghost King of Lingbi

03:13.545 --> 03:15.585
was no more after Master's passing.

03:16.105 --> 03:18.025
Where did this new Ghost King come from?

03:24.465 --> 03:25.705
Could it be…

03:29.345 --> 03:31.705
Although this is a branch of Lingbi Sect,

03:32.225 --> 03:34.185
the Ghost King is here.

03:34.985 --> 03:37.265
That means this branch
is the most prominent.

03:37.345 --> 03:39.345
You all have joined us
as fresh maidservants.

03:39.945 --> 03:41.185
You all must obey the rules.

03:41.985 --> 03:42.985
Understood?

03:43.065 --> 03:44.025
Yes, madam.

04:19.865 --> 04:21.145
What are you doing here?

04:27.185 --> 04:28.385
It's all my fault.

04:28.465 --> 04:30.985
-I got lost by accident.
-Go away!

04:31.745 --> 04:32.585
Yes, madam.

04:39.105 --> 04:40.785
How dare you leave the team
without permission?

04:40.865 --> 04:42.625
And you almost barged into
the sect's sacred ground as well.

04:42.705 --> 04:44.465
It seems you have a death wish.

04:45.465 --> 04:46.665
You shall kneel and hold
this lantern the entire night.

04:46.745 --> 04:48.185
Reflect upon your actions.

04:48.265 --> 04:49.265
Yes, madam.

04:49.785 --> 04:50.985
You're quite a handful, aren't you?

04:51.585 --> 04:52.425
Don't worry.

04:52.945 --> 04:55.545
The wax of the Tear-Concealing Candle
burns like fire.

04:56.225 --> 04:58.025
You'll just get a minor burn.

06:04.825 --> 06:07.185
Sir, Ghost King has been waiting for you.

06:07.745 --> 06:08.665
Please follow me.

07:04.665 --> 07:05.625
Was that him?

08:00.345 --> 08:02.825
Commander, are we supposed
to hide like cowards?

08:02.905 --> 08:03.945
Save your breath.

08:04.025 --> 08:05.505
-This is His Majesty's instruction.
-Yes, Commander.

09:01.265 --> 09:02.705
He does possess the Moon-Eclipse, huh?

09:22.025 --> 09:24.745
Saintess, should we acknowledge
the Ghost King?

09:25.265 --> 09:26.225
Do you know what this is?

09:27.545 --> 09:28.585
It's a willow tree.

09:28.665 --> 09:29.785
This willow

09:30.865 --> 09:32.465
is called Heartless Willow.

09:33.265 --> 09:34.465
On top of it

09:35.265 --> 09:37.105
are countless Heartbane Bugs.

09:51.785 --> 09:52.625
Saintess!

09:53.545 --> 09:54.545
What are you afraid of?

09:55.305 --> 09:56.385
You were already poisoned.

09:57.625 --> 10:00.265
Do you think I'll poison you again?

10:00.945 --> 10:02.145
I swear eternal loyalty to you, Saintess.

10:06.705 --> 10:08.785
You guys aren't loyal to me.

10:09.305 --> 10:10.505
You guys are loyal to these bugs.

10:11.745 --> 10:14.625
The Moon-Eclipse
is the most potent poison I've created.

10:15.945 --> 10:17.825
That's also exactly what I wanted.

10:19.065 --> 10:20.425
The Ghost King has resurfaced.

10:22.105 --> 10:24.225
If he does possess the Moon-Eclipse,

10:25.185 --> 10:29.065
that means he'll be
my personal possession.

10:31.345 --> 10:33.865
So, you met
the ghostly messenger under her?

10:33.945 --> 10:34.785
Indeed.

10:35.305 --> 10:36.305
Target her.

10:36.985 --> 10:38.905
She's the most loyal
ghostly messenger under her.

10:38.985 --> 10:40.465
Are you sure we can take advantage of her?

10:42.345 --> 10:45.305
One can never truly
dominate people with poison.

10:46.905 --> 10:48.745
Once we obtain the antidote,

10:48.825 --> 10:50.545
the Saintess will meet her end.

10:51.905 --> 10:54.905
Hongqing, they want
to get rid of Li Chengtian.

10:54.985 --> 10:56.865
If so, I must let them suffer as well.

11:02.905 --> 11:04.425
Clear this place out for me.

11:05.025 --> 11:06.545
Prepare to return to the Sacred Hall.

11:07.065 --> 11:07.905
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:10.185 --> 11:12.625
ONE WITH HEAVEN AND EARTH

11:15.185 --> 11:16.345
Saintess,

11:16.425 --> 11:17.745
we found one of Fenglai Pavilion's bases

11:17.825 --> 11:18.985
according to the leads on the silver coin.

11:19.585 --> 11:21.425
But the place was already empty
when we got there.

11:22.265 --> 11:25.225
They even set up explosive traps,
causing us to suffer countless casualties.

11:25.305 --> 11:26.505
I managed to survive narrowly.

11:27.145 --> 11:28.625
First, they robbed you guys.

11:28.705 --> 11:30.305
After that, they gave you guys fake leads

11:30.385 --> 11:32.505
to lure you into the traps
they had set up at Fenglai Pavilion.

11:33.145 --> 11:34.745
This bait-and-switch move

11:35.265 --> 11:36.145
was executed brilliantly. Don't you think?

11:37.665 --> 11:38.505
I deserve to die because of my fault!

11:38.585 --> 11:41.105
I'm sure an expert
is guiding them from behind.

11:41.985 --> 11:43.905
I've underestimated Fenglai Pavilion.

11:44.665 --> 11:46.865
Our sect has suffered heavy losses.

11:47.505 --> 11:50.225
It seems unlikely that we can rival
Fenglai Pavilion in the future.

11:53.065 --> 11:54.305
Go and notify the Ghost King.

11:55.785 --> 11:57.665
Tell him I shall welcome him myself.

11:58.385 --> 11:59.505
Yes, Saintess.

12:08.105 --> 12:09.825
As per your request,
these are the leaves of Heartless Willow.

12:13.065 --> 12:15.865
The Ghost King will surely
keep his promise to you.

12:23.825 --> 12:26.305
Your Majesty, will this actually work?

12:26.385 --> 12:27.945
As far as we currently understand,

12:28.545 --> 12:31.105
since the Heartbane Bugs
were raised on this plant,

12:31.945 --> 12:34.705
it's likely that it's the key
to creating the antidote.

12:36.785 --> 12:38.185
Hand them to Imperial Physician Li.

12:38.985 --> 12:40.025
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:43.825 --> 12:47.785
YAOQING HALL

12:55.985 --> 12:58.225
Ms. Yan. Look at me.

12:59.065 --> 13:00.505
Do I look like a princess now?

13:02.865 --> 13:04.465
Madam, in your current getup,

13:04.545 --> 13:06.905
you look more elegant than a princess.

13:13.305 --> 13:14.545
From today onward,

13:15.425 --> 13:17.185
my ears will finally get
some peace and quiet.

13:18.225 --> 13:20.825
I don't think anyone in the court
will go against me again.

13:22.185 --> 13:23.105
Yes, Madam.

13:26.425 --> 13:28.225
Have you prepared the items
meant for the Saintess?

13:28.865 --> 13:31.345
We have already scoured
every corner for gold and treasures

13:31.425 --> 13:34.105
to help Lingbi Sect
expand their territory.

13:34.945 --> 13:36.025
But I'm afraid

13:36.545 --> 13:38.305
we'll cause public unrest
if we keep doing so.

13:39.065 --> 13:40.065
What are you afraid of?

13:41.585 --> 13:44.225
Xiao Huan wants to abolish
the status verification system,

13:44.305 --> 13:45.905
so that the people won't need
to suffer because of taxes.

13:47.065 --> 13:49.025
But I? I insist upon the old ways.

13:49.785 --> 13:52.185
As for the Great Qi he wishes to protect,

13:54.505 --> 13:55.545
I'm going to demolish it,

13:56.425 --> 13:58.785
bit by bit.

14:14.225 --> 14:15.385
Xiao Qianqing.

14:16.265 --> 14:18.065
You have to be able to differentiate
between right and wrong.

14:18.905 --> 14:19.945
So what if you do ascend the throne?

14:20.025 --> 14:21.145
What do you think
people will think about you?

14:21.225 --> 14:23.345
You'll truly become a villain who usurped
the throne by killing your brother!

14:24.025 --> 14:26.905
Qianqing, do you like
the present I gave you?

14:28.145 --> 14:30.585
The Xiao Qianqing I love is already dead.

14:31.625 --> 14:33.185
From today onward,

14:34.305 --> 14:35.705
you and I

14:37.345 --> 14:39.665
will cut all ties.

14:41.185 --> 14:43.785
THE UNBLEMISHED INFINITE

14:54.905 --> 14:57.625
Your Highness, you didn't attend
the morning court session.

14:57.705 --> 14:59.425
It turns out that you're here,

14:59.505 --> 15:01.105
fretting over your lost love.

15:02.865 --> 15:03.985
Preceptor Du,

15:05.105 --> 15:07.105
you should mind your own business.

15:07.185 --> 15:09.025
I don't mind

15:09.665 --> 15:11.465
getting another obedient lackey
from Nanrong Palace

15:12.865 --> 15:14.385
and allowing him

15:14.465 --> 15:15.985
to enjoy the fun of being
the next Imperial Preceptor.

15:19.385 --> 15:20.585
I came to find you

15:20.665 --> 15:22.665
because I have some business

15:23.945 --> 15:25.905
with you.

15:40.345 --> 15:41.185
Du Tingxin!

15:46.265 --> 15:47.505
You think I don't dare to kill you?

15:55.625 --> 15:57.705
If you capture a bird
with a fiery personality,

15:58.385 --> 16:00.305
there's no way you can trap it in a cage.

16:01.665 --> 16:03.105
It'll think of everything
it can to escape.

16:03.745 --> 16:06.025
It will only give up
after ramming itself to death in the cage.

16:15.745 --> 16:17.225
Your Highness, please be appeased.

16:18.945 --> 16:20.025
But I have a way

16:20.945 --> 16:22.465
for you to keep her by your side.

16:38.185 --> 16:41.945
I can turn her into your personal doll.

16:42.785 --> 16:44.225
She'll be obedient, charming,

16:44.305 --> 16:45.865
and will only answer to you.

16:46.465 --> 16:49.945
She won't betray you,
no matter what happens.

16:50.905 --> 16:53.265
And from now on,
you're the only thing in the world

16:54.665 --> 16:55.705
that matters to her.

17:01.065 --> 17:03.345
In the future, you can dress her up
like your personal doll.

17:04.105 --> 17:05.665
She'll smile and cry

17:05.745 --> 17:06.905
when you want her to.

17:06.985 --> 17:08.704
If you tell her to say "I love you,"

17:08.785 --> 17:09.944
she'll say it…

17:12.944 --> 17:15.345
for all eternity.

17:36.145 --> 17:36.985
Physician Li,

17:37.505 --> 17:38.665
I brought a buddy of mine
to test your medicine…

17:38.745 --> 17:40.785
Do not speak!

18:00.785 --> 18:01.785
It's completed!

18:01.865 --> 18:04.145
Hurry and feed your buddy with it.

18:04.225 --> 18:05.145
Okay.

18:06.505 --> 18:07.545
Here.

18:20.505 --> 18:21.705
How can this be?

18:21.785 --> 18:23.185
Try ringing the Heartbane Bell.

18:37.665 --> 18:38.505
My heart no longer hurts.

18:39.105 --> 18:41.025
Young man, are you sure about that?

18:41.105 --> 18:43.065
Yes, sir.

18:44.105 --> 18:45.865
-I succeeded.
-I succeeded!

18:45.945 --> 18:46.825
-You actually succeeded.
-Yeah!

18:46.905 --> 18:48.505
We finally managed to live
up to His Majesty's expectations

18:48.585 --> 18:49.585
and created the antidote to Heartbane.

18:49.665 --> 18:52.305
Hurry and produce the antidote
according to this prescription.

18:52.385 --> 18:53.345
Yes, sir.

18:58.505 --> 18:59.905
You guys actually succeeded.

18:59.985 --> 19:02.145
Ghost King will never
go back on his promise.

19:03.105 --> 19:04.385
Why are you guys helping us out?

19:04.465 --> 19:05.305
Ghost King said

19:05.385 --> 19:07.385
that one can never truly
dominate people with poison.

19:09.505 --> 19:12.345
Someone said the same thing to me once.

19:13.825 --> 19:14.865
Who is it?

19:15.545 --> 19:17.505
It's a friend of mine. Her name is Dienu.

19:18.825 --> 19:20.705
She was also once a member of Lingbi Sect.

19:21.225 --> 19:22.065
But now,

19:22.665 --> 19:24.465
no one remembers her name anymore.

19:25.585 --> 19:26.945
She's already dead.

19:27.745 --> 19:30.625
She was killed by Heartbane
in her attempt to regain freedom.

19:31.465 --> 19:32.705
She once told me to escape with her.

19:33.305 --> 19:34.705
But I was terrified
of the heart-consuming pain.

19:34.785 --> 19:35.825
I betrayed her.

19:35.905 --> 19:36.745
Don't tell me

19:36.825 --> 19:38.425
you would rather be affected
by Heartbane for the rest of your life.

19:39.505 --> 19:41.265
Between freedom and life,
make your choice.

19:44.505 --> 19:46.865
She chose to protect her freedom

19:46.945 --> 19:48.345
by jumping off the cliff,

19:49.465 --> 19:51.305
while I managed to get by,

19:51.385 --> 19:52.825
albeit leading a regretful life.

19:54.025 --> 19:55.385
It's all in the past now.

19:56.945 --> 19:57.905
Is that so?

19:58.825 --> 20:00.665
Perhaps everything would've been different

20:01.825 --> 20:03.705
had I encountered Ghost King sooner.

20:07.305 --> 20:08.185
Your Majesty,

20:08.945 --> 20:10.225
everything has been arranged for.

20:11.505 --> 20:12.345
Excellent.

20:13.745 --> 20:16.825
The day we storm the Sacred Hall
is the day of the Saintess's death.

20:18.025 --> 20:19.665
As per your instructions,

20:19.745 --> 20:21.865
I've jotted down
her food preferences, address,

20:21.945 --> 20:23.625
hobbies, habits,
everything that's related to her.

20:28.585 --> 20:30.065
DAILY NECESSITIES: PEAR BLOSSOM
ESPECIALLY FOND OF HONEY PUFFS

20:30.865 --> 20:32.385
But are these details actually important?

20:33.185 --> 20:34.345
I thought we were going to…

20:35.585 --> 20:36.625
Pear blossom?

20:36.705 --> 20:38.665
ESPECIALLY FOND OF HONEY PUFFS

20:38.745 --> 20:40.665
Fond of honey puffs?

20:42.225 --> 20:43.065
What's the matter?

20:47.065 --> 20:48.025
It's nothing.

20:48.105 --> 20:49.105
Where's Cangcang?

20:50.785 --> 20:52.625
Her Majesty is still trying to locate you.

20:53.505 --> 20:54.505
How's the situation in the palace?

20:55.145 --> 20:57.105
Prince of Yuzhang acted as if he had
no interest in handling court affairs.

20:57.185 --> 20:58.185
But after my investigation, I found out

20:58.265 --> 21:00.105
he has already transferred
his personal guards in Southern Chu

21:00.185 --> 21:01.065
to the Capital secretly.

21:01.145 --> 21:04.225
CHANGHE GATE

21:14.425 --> 21:15.545
-Your Highness.
-What's wrong?

21:17.145 --> 21:18.385
Princess Zhong Lin was taken away
by the Imperial Preceptor.

23:26.345 --> 23:27.785
Just now, I had a dream.

23:28.945 --> 23:32.025
It was as if I fell
into a pool of black water.

23:33.385 --> 23:34.545
It was terrifyingly cold.

23:36.105 --> 23:38.265
It was just a nightmare.
You don't need to take it to heart.

23:38.865 --> 23:39.745
Is that so?

23:43.025 --> 23:44.825
So, it was just a dream.

23:47.265 --> 23:48.105
Zhong Lin,

23:49.065 --> 23:50.305
the palace is no longer safe.

23:51.225 --> 23:52.745
Du Tingxin is growing
increasingly ruthless.

23:53.785 --> 23:55.225
I don't know what'll happen after this.

23:55.305 --> 23:57.065
Just stay with me in the palace.

23:57.625 --> 24:00.345
Let's be together
for the rest of our lives, okay?

24:02.225 --> 24:03.505
Put me down.

24:05.065 --> 24:06.305
I have something to tell you.

24:33.545 --> 24:34.585
Zhong Lin,

24:35.865 --> 24:36.905
what are you up to?

24:45.265 --> 24:46.305
Xiao Qianqing.

24:47.625 --> 24:48.825
Please don't attempt such folly.

24:49.345 --> 24:50.745
Let me go.

24:50.825 --> 24:53.545
Trust me. I won't bring harm to you.

24:54.065 --> 24:56.105
-If so, in the future, we can still…
-I don't want to wait any longer.

24:57.505 --> 24:59.185
Let me go.

25:05.825 --> 25:07.865
Aunt Chan served Mother.

25:07.945 --> 25:09.185
And now, she's missing.

25:10.745 --> 25:12.225
If you want to show me the truth,

25:13.425 --> 25:15.145
you must present your evidence.

25:24.505 --> 25:25.425
Arrest the assassin!

25:25.505 --> 25:26.505
-Hurry!
-Hurry!

25:30.345 --> 25:31.825
We were late to your rescue.
Your Highness, please pardon us!

25:36.785 --> 25:37.625
Relay my order.

25:38.305 --> 25:40.265
Zhong Lin tried to assassinate me.

25:40.345 --> 25:41.465
Seal off all the palace gates.

25:42.185 --> 25:44.185
-Arrest the assassin.
-Yes, Your Highness!

25:51.225 --> 25:52.265
Over here!

25:53.345 --> 25:54.225
Come with me!

25:54.305 --> 25:55.945
Hurry! Over there!

25:56.465 --> 25:57.465
Search the area!

25:58.345 --> 25:59.305
Search over there!

25:59.385 --> 26:00.945
You guys, follow me!

26:05.385 --> 26:07.025
-Did you guys find her?
-Not yet.

26:07.625 --> 26:10.505
Dispatch all of the Imperial Guards.

26:11.385 --> 26:14.305
Find her at all costs.

26:14.385 --> 26:15.505
Yes, Your Highness!

26:23.585 --> 26:24.625
Your Highness.

26:24.705 --> 26:26.785
Escort Zhong Lin
out of the palace in secret.

26:26.865 --> 26:29.065
Yes, Your Highness.
I also made a discovery just now.

26:29.145 --> 26:30.265
Preceptor Du has left the palace.

26:50.145 --> 26:51.025
Stop right there!

27:12.385 --> 27:13.265
You,

27:14.305 --> 27:15.385
wait here for me.

27:37.825 --> 27:40.265
This is the Prison of Thousand Threads
that I had awakened with your blood.

27:40.345 --> 27:42.025
Keep it for ten days.

27:43.185 --> 27:46.265
After that, put it in the body
of the person you wish to control.

27:46.785 --> 27:49.825
The target will lose consciousness

27:49.905 --> 27:51.345
and fall under
your complete control eventually.

27:57.385 --> 27:58.625
Thank you, Saintess.

28:08.785 --> 28:10.065
Saintess, I always wanted

28:10.585 --> 28:11.905
to ask you a question.

28:13.265 --> 28:14.105
What is it?

28:15.025 --> 28:16.425
Why go out of your way to help me?

28:17.185 --> 28:19.425
Is it only because I'm
the daughter of your savior?

28:29.545 --> 28:30.465
Xin,

28:31.305 --> 28:33.185
I may have lost most of my memories,

28:34.185 --> 28:36.425
but I never forgot about your mother.

28:46.305 --> 28:47.385
Back then,

28:47.905 --> 28:50.385
I was just a junior disciple
in Lingbi Sect.

28:51.825 --> 28:52.705
But your mother?

28:53.345 --> 28:55.185
She was the most
spiritually gifted sacred maiden

28:55.265 --> 28:57.625
chosen from the Imperial family.

28:58.825 --> 29:00.945
Even so, we were the best of friends.

29:01.705 --> 29:03.145
Sui and I

29:03.905 --> 29:05.225
roamed the lands with our swords.

29:05.905 --> 29:06.745
Those days were satisfying,

29:08.065 --> 29:09.665
to say the least.

29:26.665 --> 29:27.625
Sui.

29:29.345 --> 29:30.905
What actually happened

29:32.545 --> 29:33.985
all these years?

29:37.345 --> 29:39.585
How come I can't remember any of them?

29:42.065 --> 29:43.425
The elders said

29:44.705 --> 29:46.585
I went berserk while trying to master

29:47.585 --> 29:50.265
the divine art of Lingbi,
causing me to lose my memories.

29:52.305 --> 29:53.185
But

29:54.705 --> 29:57.665
it felt like I've lost
much more than that.

30:00.905 --> 30:01.945
What are they?

30:06.865 --> 30:09.945
What exactly have I lost?

30:25.785 --> 30:26.625
Who is he?

30:28.385 --> 30:30.465
Who is this child?

30:32.825 --> 30:34.745
Why does he

30:35.705 --> 30:37.465
keep appearing in my head?

30:41.465 --> 30:42.305
Your Highness,

30:42.385 --> 30:44.305
this is a list of palace maids
found in Nanrong Palace.

30:45.825 --> 30:47.785
REGISTER OF PALACE ATTENDANTS' RETURN
LIU CHAN, LIN NIANWEI

30:58.145 --> 30:58.985
Preceptor Du,

30:59.825 --> 31:01.265
our scouts managed to track down
Ling Cangcang's whereabouts

31:01.345 --> 31:02.865
on the outskirts.

31:02.945 --> 31:04.705
We've already dispatched
our men to capture her.

31:15.465 --> 31:18.505
Zhong Lin.
Hand this letter to Xiao Qianqing.

31:18.585 --> 31:19.865
Hurry and leave!

31:19.945 --> 31:21.065
-Just go!
-Cangcang!

31:21.865 --> 31:23.065
Over there!

32:00.385 --> 32:01.345
It's you?

32:02.625 --> 32:04.265
Did he tell you to rescue me? Where is he?

32:06.105 --> 32:07.905
-I don't know.
-You don't know?

32:08.625 --> 32:10.465
Why is he avoiding me?

32:11.105 --> 32:12.785
Li Hongqing, this is an order.

32:12.865 --> 32:13.785
Take me to him immediately.

32:26.945 --> 32:28.025
You shouldn't have been here.

32:34.705 --> 32:37.625
Were you the one who left
the white umbrella at the inn?

32:38.905 --> 32:40.505
Were you the one at Lingbi Sect's branch?

32:42.345 --> 32:45.465
Are you the Ghost King?

32:45.545 --> 32:47.345
How long do you intend to avoid me?

32:48.465 --> 32:49.385
For the rest of your life?

33:18.985 --> 33:20.025
Bai,

33:20.545 --> 33:22.185
you're in a perilous spot now.

33:22.705 --> 33:24.185
You must act cautiously.

33:24.825 --> 33:26.425
I will wait for you to return safely

33:27.185 --> 33:30.425
and restore peace to the world.

33:37.545 --> 33:39.665
Your Majesty, everything is ready.

33:44.065 --> 33:44.905
Greetings, Ghost King.

33:45.985 --> 33:47.425
Ghostly messenger, lead the way.

34:16.625 --> 34:17.824
Ghost King has arrived.

34:42.585 --> 34:43.744
Greetings, Ghost King.

34:51.105 --> 34:52.545
So, you are Ghost King?

34:53.225 --> 34:54.145
That's right.

34:55.065 --> 34:56.344
I am Ghost King.

35:04.785 --> 35:06.185
I knew you harbored ulterior motives.

35:06.705 --> 35:07.545
You have a death wish.

35:39.865 --> 35:41.665
How dare you guys betray me?

35:44.545 --> 35:45.705
Could it be

35:46.305 --> 35:47.545
that you guys have forgotten

35:48.385 --> 35:50.385
about the pain of Heartbane?

36:11.025 --> 36:13.225
Did you cure them of Heartbane?

36:14.185 --> 36:15.025
Indeed.

36:15.665 --> 36:17.785
Heartbane, the poison that I've invented,

36:18.425 --> 36:19.505
it has no cure.

36:19.585 --> 36:20.945
That's because

36:21.465 --> 36:23.145
you never wanted
to cure them from the start.

36:23.225 --> 36:25.345
Ghost King managed to create an antidote

36:25.425 --> 36:26.545
and neutralized the poison for them.

36:26.625 --> 36:28.585
Why else do you think
they're betraying you?

36:30.025 --> 36:32.705
It seems you've plotted
for this day for a long time.

36:34.105 --> 36:35.105
Who exactly are you?

36:36.865 --> 36:37.945
I'm your undertaker.

37:00.985 --> 37:01.945
Dienu.

37:02.745 --> 37:03.945
I've made my choice as well,

37:04.865 --> 37:06.545
even though I might only
be free at this exact moment.

37:07.665 --> 37:08.785
I suppose that's enough.

37:13.865 --> 37:15.225
You're truly beyond salvation.

37:15.825 --> 37:18.825
Those who betray the sect
don't deserve to live.

38:22.185 --> 38:24.705
Mother, I'm so cold.

38:25.505 --> 38:26.705
Huan, be a good boy.

38:27.345 --> 38:28.905
You won't be cold
after you take the medicine.

38:29.425 --> 38:30.585
Mother,

38:31.465 --> 38:33.265
it's so bitter.

38:33.345 --> 38:37.345
Why am I the only one
who's suffering like this?

38:37.945 --> 38:41.025
Why am I the only one who has had
to take medicine from a young age?

38:41.985 --> 38:43.545
It's all my fault.

38:45.065 --> 38:47.025
I failed to protect you.

38:49.305 --> 38:51.545
Here, Huan. I'll give you some honey puffs

38:51.625 --> 38:53.705
after you finish your medicine, okay?

38:56.945 --> 38:57.825
Here.

39:06.785 --> 39:07.985
Why do you have this tattoo?

39:15.225 --> 39:16.865
Did you visit the Central Plains

39:17.505 --> 39:18.465
over two decades ago?

39:23.545 --> 39:25.185
Have you been to Great Qi

39:25.705 --> 39:27.105
over two decades ago?

39:35.145 --> 39:36.345
Have you…?

39:39.105 --> 39:40.585
Why is my child afflicted

39:40.665 --> 39:42.785
with cold-related ailments
since his birth?

39:43.585 --> 39:47.145
Why must it be him?
Why must he suffer like this?

39:47.785 --> 39:49.425
You have to leave the palace
as soon as possible.

39:50.025 --> 39:52.305
You can save Huan
only if you find the Frost Reed.

40:04.305 --> 40:06.945
This is a fake-death decoction
I made for you.

40:07.465 --> 40:08.505
The only way you can leave the palace

40:09.385 --> 40:10.985
is to drink this.

40:50.345 --> 40:51.345
Kill me.

40:59.385 --> 41:01.545
Kill me if you dare.

41:09.265 --> 41:11.305
Do you think you can rule over Lingbi Sect

41:12.505 --> 41:14.425
just because you've defeated me?

41:17.025 --> 41:19.065
You're getting ahead of yourself.

41:20.025 --> 41:21.625
When the full moon shines,

41:22.505 --> 41:23.945
the Ghost King returns to his tomb.

41:25.905 --> 41:28.705
If you want to end everything
before that happens,

41:29.985 --> 41:30.825
kill me right now!
